        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 76.86,
          "end": 79.05,
          "en": "So how do you secure this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 79.05,
          "end": 80.25,
          "en": "So one thing you can do",
