        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 82.47,
          "end": 85.44,
          "en": "Now in cryptography, basically we have a concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 85.44,
          "end": 89.22,
          "en": "of cryptography where you encrypt a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 89.22,
          "end": 91.74,
          "en": "and then on the other hand, you decrypt it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 91.74,
          "end": 94.2,
          "en": "So basically what I'm saying is when you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 94.2,
          "end": 97.56,
          "en": "to store a password, you can encrypt a password with a key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 97.56,
          "end": 99.6,
          "en": "and then when you want to verify the password,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 99.6,
          "end": 102.03,
          "en": "you can decrypt the data and you can verify the password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 102.03,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "Example, let's say we have storing h@123 here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 109.28999999999999,
          "en": "we can change this value, we can encrypt this value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 109.28999999999999,
          "end": 111.47999999999999,
          "en": "And maybe the new output you got is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 111.47999999999999,
          "end": 114.12,
          "en": "let me write the new output here, some random value here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 114.12,
          "end": 116.58,
          "en": "Let's say this is your output for this encryption.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 116.58,
          "end": 118.53,
          "en": "And then this is what you will be storing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 118.53,
          "end": 120.9,
          "en": "in a password field in the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 120.9,
          "end": 122.49,
          "en": "When you want to verify,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 122.49,
          "end": 124.35,
          "en": "of course a user will not enter this value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 124.35,
          "end": 126.87,
          "en": "User will enter h at rate 123.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 126.87,
          "end": 128.58,
          "en": "Then you have to decrypt this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 128.58,
          "end": 130.68,
          "en": "and you have to get the password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 132.06,
          "en": "and you can verify that point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 132.06,
          "end": 132.893,
          "en": "That's one way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 132.893,
          "end": 133.726,
          "en": "The problem with this is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 133.726,
          "end": 135.78,
          "en": "when you have the encryption technique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 135.78,
          "end": 137.82,
          "en": "for cryptography, you have a key, right?",
