        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 177.54,
          "end": 178.95,
          "en": "Now, how do we verify this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 178.95,
          "end": 182.22,
          "en": "So every time a user enters h at rate 123,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 182.22,
          "end": 184.98,
          "en": "then you convert that into a hash again.",
